        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 102S, Square Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 102S privacy bolt features modern style for contemporary homes. Privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This Square Privacy Lock is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Bolt (Bathroom and Bedroom):</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 102S Square Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 1-1/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 9/16\" throw solid brass bolt</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>",
